-# Markcraft Studio 1.1
+# Markcraft Studio 1.2
 
 Professional desktop application for creating editable vector logos and brand identity packages.
 
@@ -20,14 +20,18 @@ scripts\BUILD-INSTALLER.bat
 This produces:
 
 ```
-release-installer\Markcraft-Studio-Setup-1.1.0.exe
+release-installer\Markcraft-Studio-Setup-1.2.0.exe
 ```
 
 The installer works on Windows 10 / 11 (and Windows 8.1 with the pinned Electron 22 runtime).
 
 ## Features
 
-- Intelligent multi-concept generator (industry + personality aware)
+- **Concept gallery** — 4 fully composed logos per round; click one to open it, ♥ to favourite, "More like this" to explore variations, "Generate 4 more" for fresh rounds (never repeats)
+- **Layered logo engine** — backdrop layer + frame + multi-part icon + optional second symbol + ornaments, with measured typography (the mark can never cover the name)
+- **7 layouts** — stacked, horizontal, circular badge (text on a curve), ribbon emblem, monogram, wordmark (5 name stylings)
+- **Finishes** — flat, gradient + gloss, 3D extruded, embossed; metallic accents
+- **55 hand-built layered icons**, 10 frame shapes, 7 backdrops, laurel / ticks / stars ornaments, matched to 30 industries and 8 personalities
 - System font selection (no paid fonts)
 - RGB + CMYK colour tools with live preview
 - Colour harmony helpers (complement, analogous, triad, mono)
@@ -37,7 +41,8 @@ The installer works on Windows 10 / 11 (and Windows 8.1 with the pinned Electron
 - Brand package (SVG + PNG + guidelines with CMYK values)
 - Light / Dark / System themes
 - Preferences + About
-- Local project save/load
+- Local project save/load, autosave + restore, undo / redo (Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y)
+- Tight-cropped SVG / PNG export, copy SVG to clipboard
 - Quality gate before export
 
 ## Target path
diff --git a/docs/DESIGN-CRAFT.md b/docs/DESIGN-CRAFT.md
index c560ae2..76ae906 100644
--- a/docs/DESIGN-CRAFT.md
+++ b/docs/DESIGN-CRAFT.md
@@ -28,3 +28,9 @@ Markcraft's **Designer craft** engine follows methods used by professionals long
 
 ## Industry conventions
 The craft engine picks methods the way a studio would brief a designer — tech leans geometric, law leans seal/pillar, food leans organic leaf, finance leans lettermark/monogram.
+
+## 1.2 — How concepts are composed
+
+Each concept is a recipe: `layout · icon · frame · fill · finish · backdrop · badgeIcon · ornament · font pairing · name styling · colour roles`.
+The generator picks recipes from the personality's preference table and the industry's icon list, and guarantees that the 4 concepts in a round differ in layout, icon and frame, and that no recipe is ever shown twice in a session.
+Rendering measures every text run first (canvas `measureText`), builds the lockup in local units, then scales it to fit the artboard, so nothing can overlap or clip.
